The '''Pokémon Theme Park''' (Japanese: '''ポケモン広場''' ''Pokémon Plaza'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Kanto]]. It appeared in ''[[PK01|Pikachu's Vacation]]''.

It is a large playground where {{pkmn|Trainer}}s can leave their Pokémon. It has various forms of play-equipment, including a swing set, a climbing frame, a swimming pool and various other leisure activities for Pokémon to participate in. All of {{Ash}}'s, {{an|Misty}}'s, and {{an|Brock}}'s Pokémon were let out to explore the area. Four notable wild Pokémon appear here, a {{p|Raichu}}, a {{p|Snubbull}}, a {{p|Marill}} and a {{p|Cubone}}.

